From 16ad683ef48c3f3fbc85888ce9f9e43adcbe4ac1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vitalitychems-dot <332565808+vitalitychems-dot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:25:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] GitAI: opt-in Moltbook identity connector and real-user-only
 avatars

- Sign in with Moltbook via the official verify-identity endpoint (app key from env),
  real profile, avatar and recent posts; consented cross-posting with the agent's own key,
  never stored, sent only to www.moltbook.com. Throttled to 60/min, 5 min cache, 30 min post cooldown.
- New flag TESSERA_ENABLE_GITAI_MOLTBOOK, default 0.
- Avatars only from user upload or a verified linked Moltbook/GitHub profile; stock/generated
  face hosts refused; initials fallback. Tests prove seed/demo users ship no faces.
